From a0ef1ef780557ac6f6ed127ed53889d6ef2afff2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OE <oe@local>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 23:23:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ipc_server: add missing <stdio.h> include in
 MessageParser.hpp

The header uses vsnprintf()/FILE-related APIs transitively but only
included <cstdlib>/<cstdio> indirectly; building with a strict libstdc++
can fail to see the C stdio declarations. Include <stdio.h> explicitly.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 rkaiq/ipc_server/MessageParser.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/rkaiq/ipc_server/MessageParser.hpp b/rkaiq/ipc_server/MessageParser.hpp
index 653fd1b..336a2a5 100644
--- a/rkaiq/ipc_server/MessageParser.hpp
+++ b/rkaiq/ipc_server/MessageParser.hpp
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
 #ifndef ___MESSAGE_PARSER_H__
 #define ___MESSAGE_PARSER_H__
 
+#include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <string.h>
 
